e is no open question and no escalation under POL-GEN-26 or POL-RD-25. NO_ACTION is party-relative: your claim fails and the present state stands. The metered fare of 15.87 SGD (distance 8.57, time 3.60, base 2.80, platform fee 0.90) remains charged, with refund_issued_sgd 0.00; no figure is returned to either party."
